---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "探病/會客"
permalink: /visiting/
---
<h1>探病/會客規定</h1>
<p>會客時間:{{ visiting.hours }}</p>
<ul class="rules-list">
  {% for rule in visiting.rules %}
  <li>{{ rule }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<dialog id="visitor-registration-dialog" class="m3-dialog">
  <h2 class="m3-dialog__title">陪探病人員實名登記</h2>
  <p class="m3-dialog__subtitle">依規定,陪病/探病人員需完成實名登記後才能入院陪探病。請點選下方按鈕前往登記系統填寫。</p>
  <div class="m3-dialog__actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--text" id="visitor-registration-dismiss">稍後再說</button>
    <a href="{{ site.visitor_registration_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--filled" id="visitor-registration-link">
      前往實名登記
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</dialog>
